1
00:00:06,306 --> 00:00:09,086
(Penny:)Awkward silence.
Sheldon on his phone.

2
00:00:09,243 --> 00:00:13,353
(Penny:)No touching.
Somebody's having date night.

3
00:00:13,514 --> 00:00:15,654
(Amy:)It's actually steamier than it looks.

4
00:00:15,816 --> 00:00:18,596
(Amy:)Sheldon's looking up the phallic
symbolism of root vegetables

5
00:00:18,752 --> 00:00:19,992
(Amy:)in Renaissance paintings.

6
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,560
(Sheldon:)Oh, no,
I got bored with that.

7
00:00:22,723 --> 00:00:25,603
(Sheldon:)I'm just browsing cuticle scissors
on Amazon.

8
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:30,770
(Penny:)How do you not tear off his clothes
and take him here on this table?

9
00:00:30,931 --> 00:00:33,431
(Sheldon:)If you do that, I'll scream.

10
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,780
(Amy:)Sheldon, I have some exciting news
to tell you.

11
00:00:38,939 --> 00:00:41,609
(Sheldon:)That makes two of us.
My new cuticle scissors will be here

12
00:00:41,775 --> 00:00:43,615
(Sheldon:)in one to two business days.

13
00:00:43,777 --> 00:00:45,917
(Sheldon:)Come on, one.

14
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:48,289
(Amy:)I've been invited to consult
on an experiment

15
00:00:48,448 --> 00:00:50,398
(Amy:)at your university for a few months.

16
00:00:50,551 --> 00:00:53,121
(Amy:)Isn't that great?
We could have lunch together.

17
00:00:53,287 --> 00:00:54,527
(Amy:)We could carpool.

18
00:00:54,688 --> 00:00:58,968
(Sheldon:)You know, riding with Leonard
has gotten a little tedious lately.

19
00:00:59,126 --> 00:01:02,266
(Sheldon:)The only car game he ever wants
to play is the Quiet Game.

